OL,3,GNEWSA'Major delays' as section of A52
OL,4,Aclosed after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crash on the A52 near
OL,7,FRadcliffe-on-Trent has caused "major
OL,8,Fdelays".
OL,10,FThe A52, at its junction with
OL,11,FStragglethorpe Road eastbound, was shut
OL,12,Fon Tuesday morning, Nottingham City
OL,13,FTransport said, but at 10:00 BST
OL,14,FNational Highways said one lane had
OL,15,Freopened.
OL,17,FEmergency services were on scene
OL,18,Fdealing with the incident, said NCT.
OL,20,FOne eyewitness told the BBC he saw a
OL,21,Fcar on its side as he drove by.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
